   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Which <u>two</u> public policy goals are served by granting copyrights? (Choose all that apply)\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\">\n<li>By protecting the property rights of artists to their creations, the wellsprings of creation do not dry up for lack of incentive.</li>\n<li>Copyrights ensure that artists and writers won’t be taken advantage of.</li>\n<li>Cultural creativity serves the public good and promotes literacy and learning.</li>\n</ol>",
